<title>POLAND: NFI units seen at PLN 190.8 in mid-1997.</title>
<headline>NFI units seen at PLN 190.8 in mid-1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brokerages see mass privatisation National Investment Fund (NFI) units rising to 190.8 zlotys by the end of June, 1.4 percent less than they predicted a month ago, a poll by the daily Nowa Europa showed.</p>
<p>The brokerages expected the units to be trading at 172.8 zlotys at the end of February this year.</p>
<p>NFI units closed on the Warsaw bourse at 165 zlotys on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
